# i18n

- Locales: `es` (default), `en`. Add new codes in `src/i18n/config.ts`, Astro `i18n.locales`, and a folder under `src/i18n/locales/`.
- Routes are prefixed: `/es/...`, `/en/...` (`prefixDefaultLocale: true`).
- User-facing copy goes in locale dictionaries (`src/i18n/locales/{locale}/`), not inline in components.
- Keep English dictionaries structurally aligned with Spanish (`satisfies CommonMessages` or shared types).
- Use `getRelativeLocaleUrl` for internal links. Language switcher must cover every configured locale.
- Runtime helper: `i18next` via `src/i18n/ui.ts`; prefer `getCommon(locale)` for typed section copy in Astro.
